  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/00ab595d2f3521960fd5901014ac4433521260ff.png\" alt=\"注目\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p>《多樣小精靈》是追求更多樣化體驗的完美資源包，內含超過 200 種自訂變體。此版本加入了由 FreshLX 打造的《生動動畫》資源包之自訂動畫！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5894088237e8c5164eb150892d1ee268befe4665.png\" alt=\"橫幅\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/478a94a0cfc1ccfdcd5594cb9fd0ea995deb1003.png\" alt=\"附加模組\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p>本資源包需要以下標註的模組：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1ad839ff3ba39226c2e38561fed87845e8314a22_0.webp\" alt=\"OptiFine 或 EMF/ETF\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7925f8af6bb75eb904febe9b92c84a6c902ba4d7.png\" alt=\"功能特色\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p>這些生物變體均可重新命名以對應其專屬外觀，且能自然生成。本資源包的結構設計便於製作附加模組！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/71e8f0a9dd8a85f4cdcf6a895a554554d3b111d9.png\" alt=\"小精靈縮圖\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ae7040573760b45a4840469e65396ef3f07c4896.png\" alt=\"備註\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p>以下資源包必須按照以下順序排列：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/08e4108ca6c915c723affac215d7fea8f8bf09f6.png\" alt=\"小精靈順序\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6mb4QDE.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"discord.gg/kYYmAWQ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0f2d9f2c414441c5741f635153fc6820f884bfd9_0.webp\" alt=\"Discord 連結\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.sparkedhost.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d3078\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6bcd4c7a1170269c7c6f9422f2bc574184de8942.jpeg\" alt=\"Spark 伺服器\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/eda2698ccdd602757b99afcb8431a6e875e5ea2f.png\" alt=\"授權資訊\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>《生動動畫》由 FreshLX 擁有並發行</strong></p>\n<p><strong>所有非本人製作的素材均已獲得原作者的授權使用！</strong></p>